<mj-text><p>A <code>550 5.7.1</code> means the receiving server refused the message on policy, not because the mailbox is missing.</p><h2>Read the whole line</h2></mj-text>
<mj-image src="/media/0193d7a2-0000-7000-8000-000000000000/bounce.png" alt=""></mj-image>
<mj-text><p>Watch on Vimeo: <a href="https://vimeo.com/76979871">https://vimeo.com/76979871</a></p></mj-text>
<mj-divider></mj-divider>
<mj-text><p>Next time: reading a DMARC report.</p></mj-text>
